  description: "For Captain Overload, quantity beats quality. He starts with just
    two dice, but his ability to break down big rolls into many small ones lets him
    flood the board. Play him right, and he\u2019ll turn a single turn into a rolling
    frenzy."
  AbilitiesTXT: "<b>Dice Cash-out</b> \u2013 Converts a die into multiple dice of
    1s\n\n<b>Rolling Spree</b> - His special die grants an extra die when played."
